PATENT NOTICE:
This thesis describes novel technologies including:
  • Quantum-Casimir Energy Harvesting (QCEH) systems
  • Entanglement-Directed Photonic Energy Transfer (EDPET) protocols
  • Li-N-Graphene synthesis and doping techniques
  • Energy routing algorithms using quantum entanglement

Patent applications have been filed or are pending for key inventions.

