SECTION 6: ATTRIBUTION REQUIREMENTS
================================================================================

When using any part of this thesis, you MUST include:

Format 1 (Text):
  "Adapted from 'Quantum-Casimir Energy Harvesting and Entanglement-Directed 
  Energy Management in Lithium-Nitrogen Co-Doped Graphene Quantum Systems' 
  by Rolando M Garcia (2026)"

Format 2 (BibTeX):
  @phdthesis{Garcia2026,
    author = {Garcia, Rolando M},
    title = {Quantum-Casimir Energy Harvesting and Entanglement-Directed 
             Energy Management in Lithium-Nitrogen Co-Doped Graphene 
             Quantum Systems},
    school = {[Institution Name]},
    year = {2026}
  }

Format 3 (Full Citation):
  Garcia, R. M. (2026). Quantum-Casimir energy harvesting and entanglement-
  directed energy management in lithium-nitrogen co-doped graphene quantum 
  systems. [Institution Name], Department of Quantum Physics.

